OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'devoted' dad and
OL,4,A'selfless' man killed in van crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies have paid tribute to two men
OL,7,Fwho died after a van crashed off a
OL,8,Fcountry lane in Cheshire.
OL,10,FJason Clark, 53, a father of four from
OL,11,FRuncorn, and Marlon Kent, 52, from
OL,12,FHolmes Chapel, died after the incident
OL,13,Fin Goostrey on 3 November, Cheshire
OL,14,FPolice said.
OL,16,FClark was described by his family as a
OL,17,F"fun-loving and devoted dad" who
OL,18,Fsupported his community, while Kent was
OL,19,Fremembered as a devoted son who "went
OL,20,Fout of his way to help others".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
